      {month:'2026-07',status:'NOTABLE',label:'Negotiator-side compromise proven: Martino sentenced to 70 months (Jul 10)',detail:'A serving ransomware negotiator at a US incident response firm sold client insurance limits and negotiation strategy to BlackCat across five victim cases; $10 million in assets seized, one victim paid ~$1.2 million. First documented penetration of the victim-side intermediation layer, and the strongest July evidence for licensing, vetting and disclosure requirements at the payment-facilitation layer.',conf:'CONFIRMED'}
